#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/portal/general.js:20
msgid "Portal"
msgstr "门户"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/portal/general.js:21
msgid ""
"A static HTML portal served by the web server the router already runs, under "
"the /portal/ sub-path. Settings are persisted in uci and baked into "
"links.json on apply."
msgstr ""
"由路由器已在运行的 Web 服务器在 /portal/ 子路径下提供的静态 HTML 门户。设置保"
"存在uci 中，应用时烘焙进 links.json。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/portal/general.js:27
msgid "General"
msgstr "常规"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/portal/general.js:37
msgid "Enable portal"
msgstr "启用门户"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/portal/general.js:38
msgid ""
"Publish the portal page, or take it off the web server. When off, /portal/ "
"stops resolving; the uploaded icons and backgrounds are kept."
msgstr ""
"发布门户页面，或把它从 Web 服务器上撤下。关闭后 /portal/ 不再解析；已上传的图"
"标与背景图会保留。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/portal/general.js:43
msgid "Page title"
msgstr "页面标题"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/portal/general.js:46
msgid "Background colour"
msgstr "背景颜色"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/portal/general.js:47
msgid "A CSS colour value such as #0e1116."
msgstr "CSS 颜色值，例如 #0e1116。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/portal/general.js:55
msgid "Current background image"
msgstr "当前背景图片"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/portal/general.js:56
msgid "Chosen on the Assets page. It takes precedence over the colour."
msgstr "在「素材库」页选择，优先级高于背景颜色。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/portal/general.js:60
msgid "none"
msgstr "无"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/portal/general.js:82
msgid "Background veil"
msgstr "背景遮罩强度"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/portal/general.js:83
msgid ""
"How strongly a background image is dimmed, in percent. 0 leaves the photo as "
"it is, 100 hides it behind a solid scrim. Only applies when a background "
"image is set."
msgstr ""
"背景图被压暗的程度（百分比）。0 表示保持照片原样，100 表示用纯色遮罩完全盖"
"住。仅在设置了背景图时生效。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/portal/general.js:92
msgid "Background blur"
msgstr "背景磨砂模糊"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/portal/general.js:93
msgid ""
"Frosted-glass blur applied to a background image, in percent of the maximum "
"(20 px). 0 keeps the photo sharp."
msgstr ""
"对背景图施加的磨砂模糊，以最大值（20 px）的百分比表示。0 表示照片保持清晰。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/portal/general.js:102
msgid "Bookmark transparency"
msgstr "书签透明度"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/portal/general.js:103
msgid ""
"Transparency of the bookmark cards, in percent. 0 makes them solid, 100 lets "
"the background shine through completely; the text stays readable either way."
msgstr ""
"书签卡片的透明度（百分比）。0 表示完全不透明，100 表示背景完全透出；两种取值"
"下文字都保持可读。"

